// endpoint_roll_back.proto — RollBack: perform a confirmed rollback plan.
// ROLLBACK section.
//
// The daemon performs the whole rollback as one operation, under its prompt
// queue's ownership of the turn sequence so no prompt is delivered part way:
// drop the held prompts the plan named, have the shim interrupt the running
// turn, (restoring files) stop the dropped turns' detached work and restore
// the files, and resume the vendor conversation just before the prompt; then
// remove the dropped turns from the feed, durably, so neither a reload nor a
// restart draws them again. On success Emacs saves the composer's contents to
// its history and fills it with the prompt that was rolled back.

